+issueNumber: MDL-89346
+notes:
+  mod_assign:
+    - message: >-
+        The external function `mod_assign_get_submission_status` now returns
+        the feedback given by each marker (in assignments using multiple
+        markers) in the new optional `markers` field of the `feedback` and
+        `previousattempts` structures. Each marker entry contains the mark id,
+        the marker user id and the feedback plugins information for that
+        marker.
+      type: changed
